# madcide "classic" scheme: the bright/bold look. Same vocabulary as
# default.theme; swap with ^K T (theme names are file names).
keyword bold white
type bold cyan
string bold green
number bold magenta
comment green
function bold yellow

# @presence (client-server V3c): the caret colours dealt round-robin to
# clients at connect (a slot per line; the window renders another client's
# caret in its slot colour, the TUI ignores these). Eight distinguishable
# entries over the sixteen-colour palette (bold = bright).
@presence 0 cyan
@presence 1 magenta
@presence 2 yellow
@presence 3 green
@presence 4 red
@presence 5 blue
@presence 6 bold cyan
@presence 7 bold magenta
